From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anatoliy Shulika <shulikaa@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: broadcom: archer-c2300-v1: enable PCIe

Both PCIe controllers are populated on this board: PCIE0 carries the
5 GHz BCM4366 (14e4:4365) and PCIE1 the 2.4 GHz BCM4360 (14e4:4360).
Enable them so the radios are enumerated.

Signed-off-by: Anatoliy Shulika <shulikaa@icloud.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcmbca/bcm4906-tplink-archer-c2300-v1.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcmbca/bcm4906-tplink-archer-c2300-v1.dts
@@ -189,3 +189,16 @@
 		};
 	};
 };
+
+/*
+ * Both PCIe links are confirmed populated on this board (see the
+ * pcie0/pcie1 comment in bcm4908.dtsi for the boot-log evidence).
+ * PCIE2 is confirmed empty and is intentionally left undescribed.
+ */
+&pcie0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&pcie1 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
